msgid "**End of life.** Infinito.Nexus neither maintains nor tests this role, because the deployment can neither auto-provision it nor drive it through a test: since Akaunting 3.1 every create is gated behind `api.akaunting.com/plans/limits`, which answers 403 without an account API key, so no invoice, customer or user can be created unattended. The default `INFINITO_LIFECYCLES` envelope keeps the role out of every CI round. Use [ERPNext](../web-app-erpnext/README.md) or [Odoo](../web-app-odoo/README.md) instead; both cover the same ledger, invoicing and contact surfaces and pin the version they run. Deploy it at your own risk and take support from [akaunting.com](https://akaunting.com)."
msgstr ""

