msgid "**Gateway token:** Without single sign-on, a generated gateway token guards the Control UI and the API. With single sign-on, the same secret is the gateway password (`OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD`) for the CLI inside the container, which reaches the gateway over loopback. The Control UI accepts its domain in every network the gateway is served on, such as the clearnet domain and its onion sibling, as its allowed origins."
