msgid "**LDAP role groups:** the LDAP import maps the RBAC role groups ``cn=web-app-zammad-<role>`` under the roles OU onto the same Zammad roles as ``ZAMMAD_RBAC_ROLE_GRANTS`` (``ZAMMAD_LDAP_GROUP_ROLE_MAP``). A directory user in none of them gets Zammad’s signup role (``Customer``), so any directory user can open tickets. The import is the leading source for the roles of every directory user: it runs at deploy, on Zammad’s own LDAP schedule and from the admin panel’s LDAP integration."
