msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` or `/roles/web-app-kix/user` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. On every sign-in `GroupDNBasedRoleSync` sets the KIX roles from the role groups: `administrator` grants `Superuser`, `user` grants `Ticket Agent`, and a role the user no longer holds is revoked."
