msgid "**Persisted state marker:** `<instance>/.app-control-state` holds `started` or `stopped` and is the single source of truth. Without a marker, the application is created in the `status` of its `services.semaphore` entry; a redeploy brings the application up, configures it, and pauses it again when its marker says `stopped`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Persisted state marker:** ``<instance>/.app-control-state`` holds ``started`` or ``stopped`` and is the single source of truth. Without a marker, the application is created in the ``status`` of its ``services.semaphore`` entry; a redeploy brings the application up, configures it, and pauses it again when its marker says ``stopped``."
