msgid "**Role Groups:** Every LDAP sign-in refreshes name and email from the directory and sets the account flags from the role groups: ``administrator`` grants superuser and staff, ``moderator``, ``librarian`` and ``settings-manager`` grant the moderation, library and settings permission. A user outside a group loses its flag at the next sign-in. The settings module `templates/settings.py.j2 <./templates/settings.py.j2>`__ extends ``config.settings.production``."
