msgid "**Role Groups:** On every new session `files/sso/header_auth.py <./files/sso/header_auth.py>`__ sets the BookWyrm groups ``admin``, ``owner``, ``moderator`` and ``editor`` from the ``administrator``, ``owner``, ``moderator`` and ``editor`` role groups and grants staff with ``admin``. The platform administrator that `tasks/01_site.yml <./tasks/01_site.yml>`__ converges keeps its groups."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Role Groups:** [files/elixir/rbac.exs](./files/elixir/rbac.exs) creates the Keycloak accounts of the `administrator` and `moderator` role group members that have none yet and sets the role of every Keycloak account to administrator, moderator or user from its groups. The platform administrator keeps its role. [files/python/rbac_sync.py](./files/python/rbac_sync.py) runs it through `mobilizon rpc` as a host hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer, so a group change in Keycloak or LDAP reaches Mobilizon within one timer interval."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Role Groups:** [files/sql/reconcile-roles.sql](./files/sql/reconcile-roles.sql) creates the accounts of the `administrator` and `collaborator` role group members that have none yet and sets the role of every account to administrator, collaborator or visitor from its groups. It runs through `psql` in the database container as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer, so a group change reaches Fider within one timer interval. The platform administrator keeps its role."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Role Groups:** `files/elixir/rbac.exs <./files/elixir/rbac.exs>`__ creates the Keycloak accounts of the ``administrator`` and ``moderator`` role group members that have none yet and sets the role of every Keycloak account to administrator, moderator or user from its groups. The platform administrator keeps its role. `files/python/rbac_sync.py <./files/python/rbac_sync.py>`__ runs it through ``mobilizon rpc`` as a host hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer, so a group change in Keycloak or LDAP reaches Mobilizon within one timer interval."
