msgid "**`--full-cycle` (update pass).** When set (or `full_cycle=true` on `make compose-deploy`), the wrapper runs each round's deploy TWICE: first the regular pass, then immediately a second pass with `-e DEPLOY_IS_UPDATE=true`, against the SAME variant's folder, BEFORE moving to the next round. The two passes are therefore always co-located on the same host state; the update pass never accidentally targets a host that a previous round's variant left behind."
