msgid "Follow the instructions from AGENTS.md, then build and dispatch the priority line exactly as this skill describes. Begin by clarifying every open requirement with the `active-listening` skill (escalating any root-cause or design question you are not ~99% sure of to the `dialectic` skill), then work under the `robot` skill. Every token MUST pin all eight axes; a token that leaves one to the rotation is not a verification row and MUST NOT be dispatched. Never dispatch a line the validator refuses, and report per candidate what each pin rests on and which question the run will not answer."
