msgid "For Compose hosts the inventory holds no ``svc-swarm-manager``, so the writer plans full meshes. Put the same ``svc-net-wireguard.networks.meshes`` declaration into the ``host_vars`` of every member, list the meshes a host joins under ``networks.meshes`` of a role it carries, add the hosts to the ``svc-net-wireguard`` group, write the mesh as above and deploy. Each member listens on the mesh port, so that UDP port must be open between the members. The role brings the interfaces up and gates on a handshake with every peer; an application uses the tunnel only where it is pointed at a peer’s mesh address, which ``lookup('mesh_address', <host>)`` returns."
msgstr ""

