msgid "No Playwright scenario gates on ``ldap``, and ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ suppresses the service-gate check for ``LDAP_SERVICE_ENABLED``. Shopware has no LDAP sign-in of its own and the role installs no admin-LDAP extension, so there is no LDAP-bind surface to drive: with ``sso`` on, directory accounts reach the administration through Keycloak’s user federation and the AdminOpenAuth provider, which ```files/playwright/test-rbac.js`` <./files/playwright/test-rbac.js>`__ covers; with ``sso`` off, no directory account reaches Shopware."
