# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) names the nine read tools of `calendar`, `contacts` and `files` — the three categories whose upstream `is_available` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked `mutating` while `mutating_tools_enabled` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract's `schema_sha256` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Adapteri sitoo sen. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) nimet yhdeksän lukea työkaluja `calendar`, `contacts` sekä `files` `is_available` ei ole ehdoton, joten sarja ei vaihtele minkä valinnaisia sovelluksia käyttöönotto asentaa. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` hylkää minkä tahansa luettelon ulkopuolisen työkalun ja kaikki merkityt työkalut `mutating` ja `mutating_tools_enabled` on väärä, ja se kieltäytyy aloittamasta ollenkaan, jos sopimuksen `schema_sha256` ei vastaa tiedostoa. Kieltäytyminen tapahtuu sivuvaunussa, joten se pätee jokaiseen asiakkaaseen riippumatta siitä, mitä kukin tekee paikallisesti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Adapteri sitoo sen. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` ei vastaa tiedostoa. Kieltäytyminen tapahtuu sivuvaunussa, joten se pätee jokaiseen asiakkaaseen riippumatta siitä, mitä kukin tekee paikallisesti."

