msgid "The native administrator's password does not converge: `tasks/04_native_admin.yml` calls `com.atproto.server.createAccount` on every deploy and treats `400 Handle already taken` as success, so on an existing account a rotated `users.administrator.password` never reaches the PDS and `createSession` (native admin test, design spec sign-in) fails with the new value. Options: after the 400, probe `createSession` and on 401 set the password through `com.atproto.admin.updateAccountPassword` with the PDS admin credentials in the request body."
