msgid "This role builds its own Moodle image from upstream Moodle source on top of the official `php:8.3-fpm` base and installs the Composer dependencies that source declares. The NGINX sidecar serves the `public` directory of the code volume and hands every other path to Moodle's router."
msgstr ""

