# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ is a cryptographic network protocol for operating network services securely over an unsecured network. The `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ project provides the reference implementation, including ``ssh-agent`` for managing authentication keys."
msgstr "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ on salausverkkoprotokolla, joka koskee verkkopalvelujen käyttöä turvallisesti vakuudettoman verkon kautta. • `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ hanke tarjoaa viitetoteutuksen, mukaan lukien ``ssh-agent`` tunnistusavaimen hallinta."

