msgid "`stalwart-migrate` 1.0.0 to 1.0.3 report differences where none exist: email `keywords` holding a `\\` system flag, contact card `vcard` with extra vCard 3.0 `N` or `ADR` components, and certificate or IP ban settings that the 1.x start inside the tool refreshes or expires. These releases also skip accounts that have no change counter. When the rows are only of these kinds and the state was written by such a release, start over with the pinned release: as a PostgreSQL superuser run `DROP DATABASE stalwart_v1;`, move `migrate-v016/state` aside and deploy again."
